   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Why does finding proof that protons do not decay not disprove all GUTs?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 764735,
     "content_html": "Proton decay is not a premise of all GUTs, and current GUTs can be amended in response to new findings."
